From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emaki contributors <emaki@localhost>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Retain greeter scanout and cover fresh session startup

Consume a final-frame PNG before the first output render, exclude it from
all captures, and expose an idempotent release and remaining-budget IPC.
Bound coverage to eight seconds, keep critical UI above it, and release
immediately for a session lock. Retain greeter scanout using CLOSEFB and
pause; suppress stale saved-framebuffer restoration in the next session.

Generated from the worktree with git diff; no commit or index mutation.
